ent:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-24/03-supertone-supertonic-3.png\" alt=\"Supertone/supertonic-3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Supertone/supertonic-3</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Supertonic-3是由Supertone开发的一款专注于音频处理的先进模型。该模型在语音合成、音质增强及声音建模方面表现卓越，通过提供Python SDK与在线演示，广泛应用于虚拟人驱动、创意媒体创作及音频后期处理场景，能够为用户提供高质量且自然流畅的语音交互体验。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-05-24/04-tencent-hy-mt2-30b-a3b.png\" alt=\"tencent/Hy-MT2-30B-A3B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;p